# Never send these into a Docker build context. Their absence here was a real
# bug: without it, `COPY api ./` / `COPY worker ./` / `COPY web ./` copied this
# HOST machine's node_modules (Windows-native Prisma engine, host dist/ build
# output) into the Linux build stage, silently overwriting the container's own
# freshly-`npm ci`'d node_modules — confirmed to cause exactly the kind of
# platform-mismatch failure the multi-stage build is supposed to prevent.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.git
**/*.log
staging/data
staging/mock/certs
